d figures), operating income to $1.3 billion and net income to $835 million.","cites":["FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.1 billion: operating cash flow of $1.1 billion less capital spending of $2.1 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $702 million at the end of FY2026, against $656 million a year earlier. That is 27.7% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["FICO.rpo.2026","FICO.rpo.2025","FICO.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $224 million at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $189 million a year earlier.","cites":["FICO.deferred.2026","FICO.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 3,747 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $677,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["FICO.q.employees","FICO.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $27.3 million, after $10.9 million in FY2025.","cites":["FICO.restructuring.2026","FICO.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $218 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $5.3 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Debt less cash was $5 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["FICO.cash.2026","FICO.debtLong.2026","FICO.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"FICO":{}},"quotes":{"FICO.q.employees":{"c":"FICO","kind":"employees","n":3747,"quote":"As of September 30, 2026, we employed 3,747 persons across 31 countries.","source":"FICO-0000814547-26-000042","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-11-06","proof":"f34deb11c784c2c49d71226bf7f3e85cc931c9affd1aee41dda68638152bf158"}}}